# {{lb|en|baseball}} When a [[batter]] reaches base with a [[ground ball]] that does not leave the [[infield]] or shallow [[outfield]].
#: ''Jones got an '''infield hit''' when the ball tipped off of the outstretched glove of the diving shortstop.''

